    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1481">

                <pb facs="1194" n="1078" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1078"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/243.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-10-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 9, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The loan contract between American bankers and Nicaragua, of Sept. 1, 1911, was
                    approved today by the National Constituent I Assembly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
